                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ccf366e-1b73-3139-a7e3-dfca5f7adc2a",
                        "entry_id": "dacbc571-f10f-35ba-9e4a-8e9eb51fd3c1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bathymetry (measurement of the depths of oceans, seas and other water bodies using special devices of different systems)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a227d413-362a-497a-866f-04f3e18ce02f",
                                "sense_id": "5ccf366e-1b73-3139-a7e3-dfca5f7adc2a",
                                "text": "В результáте одногó из такúх нарушéний, предопределíвшего положéние бассéйна Дáрса, от Сокóтры были отсечены островá «Брáтья» (Сáмха и Дáрса), а в батимéтрии появúлся глубокúй залúв, вдаю́щийся в шельф архипелáга с зáпадо-северо-зápада.",
                                "translation": "As a result of one of these disturbances, which predetermined the position of the Darsa basin, the “Brothers” islands (Samha and Darsa) were cut off from Socotra, and a deep bay appeared in the bathymetry, jutting into the shelf of the archipelago from the west-northwest.",
                                "english": "As a result of one of these disturbances, which predetermined the position of the Darsa basin, the “Brothers” islands (Samha and Darsa) were cut off from Socotra, and a deep bay appeared in the bathymetry, jutting into the shelf of the archipelago from the west-northwest."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
